  "item_short_desc": "<p>Prepare for any weather with our Rip-Stop Poncho. Engineered with durable polyester rip-stop fabric, the military poncho shields against wet weather while withstanding harsh terrain, ensuring long-lasting use while outdoors. The rain poncho is great for field use, bug-out bags, and emergency situations. Available in solid colors and camouflage patterns for varied preferences.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
